main label sumNumbers within none
main label sumNumbers maxIterations numberCount
main label sumNumbers over numbers
main label addNumber loopKind none
main label addNumber within sumNumbers
main label summed loopKind none
main label summed within none
main label readMissingDone loopKind none
main label readMissingDone within none
main label noItem loopKind none
main label noItem within none
main label writeNoItemDone loopKind none
main label writeNoItemDone within none
main label fillNames loopKind none
main label fillNames within none
main label printNames loopKind forEach
main label printNames within none
main label printNames maxIterations nameCount
main label printNames over names
main label printName loopKind none
main label printName within printNames
main label writeNameDone loopKind none
main label writeNameDone within printNames
main label fillPoints loopKind none
main label fillPoints within none
main label sumX loopKind forEach
main label sumX within none
